UID:SFlwuShUal
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nSpecial encore screening for Nati
 onal Cat Day! The world's #1 cat video festival is back with screenings i
 n theaters across the USA and around the world. A portion of ticket sales
  will support PAWS (​​Progressive Animal Welfare Society). NEKO Cat C
 afe will be tabling in the lobby before showtime. 🐱\n\nhttps://www.siff
 .net/cinema/in-theaters/cat-vid-fest-26\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
