 tional mountain film festival showcasing a selection of inspiring adventur
 e\, climbing\, skiing\, mountaineering\, and outdoor films. Each screening
  features several short and medium-length documentaries celebrating explor
 ation\, human achievement\, and the natural world.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net
 /cinema/in-theaters/mountains-on-stage-winter-edition-2026\n\nEstimated st
 art: 19:15
