SUMMARY:20\,000 Species of Bees (2023)
DTSTART:20270112T023000Z
DTEND:20270112T045000Z
DTSTAMP:20270112T023000Z
UID:agopS0h9fs
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 125 mins (2h05m)\n\nSIFF Movie ClubA gender-question
 ing eight-year-old and their mother spend a summer in the country with the
 ir family’s widowed matriarch\, where tending to the beehives leads to i
 lluminating and deeply personal revelations. Winner of Best Film at the 20
 23 Málaga Film Festival. Intro by Cinema Lead Bee Betz.\n\nhttps://www.s
 iff.net/programs-and-events/siff-movie-club/20000-species-of-bees\n\nEstim
 ated start: 18:45
